cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Adelpha MRI
message: If you use Adelpha MRI, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
authors:
  - name: Adelpha contributors
  - name: Accessible Magnetic Resonance Laboratory
    alias: AMRL
repository-code: "https://github.com/imr-framework/adelpha"
url: "https://imr-framework.github.io/adelpha/"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - low-field MRI
  - magnetic resonance imaging
  - MRI console
  - MRI digital twin
  - MaRCoS
  - Red Pitaya
  - medical imaging
abstract: >-
  Adelpha MRI is an open-source low-field MRI console and digital twin
  for scanner control, acquisition, monitoring, engineering, and
  AI-assisted workflows. The desktop shell and DTAM twin are MIT-licensed.
  The imaging console tree (console/) is GNU GPL v3, derived from the
  MRI4ALL Zeugmatron Z1 console.
